<title>USA: Buffalo, Minn., won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Buffalo, Minn., won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it won $6.965 million of Buffalo, Minn., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.64 percent.</p>
